# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/

# The interaction log is a passive export; the Dolt database is the source of
# truth and syncs over refs/dolt/data. Tracking it made every branch conflict
# server-side: .gitattributes marks it merge=union, which resolves locally but
# GitHub does not apply merge drivers when it computes mergeability, and GitHub
# does not run pull_request workflows on a conflicted PR. CI was silently
# skipped on most PRs as a result (throwntom-80k).
.beads/interactions.jsonl

# brainstorming visual-companion mockups
.claude/brainstorm/
